#. module: l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation.field_hr_employee__l10n_us_state_withholding_allowance
msgid ""
"Add the allowance the employee wants to deduct from their State's "
"withholding (usually an annual amount) according to their State Withholding "
"Certificate. If the employee didn't fill out a State Withholding "
"Certificate, leave it blank"
msgstr ""
"Agrega la cantidad que el empleado quiere deducir de su retención estatal "
"(por lo general, un monto anual) de acuerdo con su Certificado de retención "
"estatal. Si el empleado no completó un Certificado de retención estatal, "
"déjalo en blanco."

#. module: l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation
#: model:hr.salary.rule,name:l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation.l10n_us_employee_salary_co_state_income_tax
msgid "CO State Income Tax"
msgstr "CO State Income Tax"

#. module: l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation.model_hr_employee
msgid "Employee"
msgstr "Empleado"

#. module: l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation.field_hr_employee__l10n_us_state_extra_withholding
msgid ""
"Extra amount the employee requests to be withheld per pay period according "
"to their State Withholding Certificate. If the employee didn't fill out a "
"State Withholding Certificate, leave it blank."
msgstr ""
"Monto adicional que el empleado solicita que se retenga por periodo de pago "
"según su Certificado de retención estatal. Si el empleado no completó un "
"Certificado de retención estatal, déjalo en blanco."

#. module: l10n_us_hr_payroll_state_calculation
